{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two people stood on the bridge. They smiled and looked into each other's eyes. Suddenly, the boy whispered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I know everything.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl shuddered with terror. A third participant in the drama entered the scene - a knife. The corpse fell and disappeared into the raging river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's for the last day. As of right now.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* &gt;5 unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* &gt;19 CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Walkthrough: 40-50 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u0421haracters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/extras/e71b02fabe4c471d67bc41867d74bb0d.avif?t=1773600561\" width=960 height=640 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/extras/eb3b3ef78310bb283b1d0fd30b4df137.avif?t=1773600561\" width=960 height=640 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615870?t=1773600561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/b6ecabbf02f51a33d1cb5a5c53cb5f7d12d1cabd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773600561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773600561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773600561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc